### register
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "bryan",
    "password": "bryan123",
    "email": "username@domain.com"
}

### login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "bryan",
    "password": "bryan123",
    "email": "username@domain.com"
}


### refresh token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie:refresh_token=iJUo2aPxoBR3jjNTgdtxJYylq32USfDPoaT9vmN5_E8; Max-Age=2592000; Expires=Sun, 01 Feb 2026 20:09:43 GMT; Path=/api/auth/refresh; Secure; HTTPOnly; SameSite=Strict 

### logout 
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Cookie:refresh_token=iJUo2aPxoBR3jjNTgdtxJYylq32USfDPoaT9vmN5_E8; Max-Age=2592000; Expires=Sun, 01 Feb 2026 20:09:43 GMT; Path=/api/auth/refresh; Secure; HTTPOnly; SameSite=Strict 
